---
description: >-
  ER diagram covering three entities each with their own attribute block,
  related by two relationships, rendered under the "neo" look with the "neo"
  theme.
config:
  look: neo
  theme: neo
---
erDiagram
    CUSTOMER {
        string name
        string custNumber
        string sector
    }
    ORDER {
        int orderNumber
        string deliveryAddress
    }
    LINE-ITEM {
        string productCode
        int quantity
        float pricePerUnit
    }
    CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places
    ORDER ||--|{ LINE-ITEM : contains
